  "distanthorizons.config.title": "Distant Horizons 配置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client": "客户端",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickEnableRendering": "启用渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickEnableRendering.@tooltip": "启用后，Distant Horizons 会在原版渲染距离之外渲染 LOD 地形。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickShowWorldGenProgress": "显示 LOD 生成／导入进度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.quickShowWorldGenProgress.@tooltip": "启用后，运行世界生成或导入任务时会在屏幕上显示进度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.qualityPresetSetting": "画质预设",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.qualityPresetSetting.@tooltip": "同时调整多项图形选项，快速改变 Distant Horizons 的渲染画质。\n\n如果 GPU 已满载或帧率不足，请降低此设置。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.threadPresetSetting": "CPU 负载",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.threadPresetSetting.@tooltip": "调整 Distant Horizons 使用的线程数量。\n\n提高此值可加快远景生成和 LOD 加载，\n但也会增加 CPU 和内存占用，并可能导致卡顿。\n\n注意：此设置按 CPU 性能比例生效。\n对 2 核和 64 核 CPU 造成的相对负载应基本相同。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.optionsButton": "显示选项按钮",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.optionsButton.@tooltip": "在视野滑块左侧显示配置按钮",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced": "高级选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics": "图形",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.worldGenerator": "世界生成器",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.lodBuilding": "LOD 构建",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiThreading": "多线程",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.logging": "日志",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality": "画质",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius": "LOD 区块渲染半径",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodChunkRenderDistanceRadius.@tooltip": "Distant Horizons 的渲染距离，以区块为单位。\n\n注意：此数值是尽力达到的目标。\n实际渲染距离可能高于或低于此值，\n具体取决于其他图形设置。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality": "LOD 画质衰减距离",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalQuality.@tooltip": "控制 LOD 画质逐级降低之间的距离。\n\n提高此值会拉大各级画质衰减的间隔，\n但也会增加内存与 GPU 占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution": "最大水平分辨率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxHorizontalResolution.@tooltip": "LOD 能渲染的最高细节等级。\n\n§6最快：§r区块\n§6最精细：§r方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality": "垂直画质",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.verticalQuality.@tooltip": "决定 LOD 对悬空地形、洞穴、峭壁等结构的还原程度。\n\n更高的设置会增加内存与 GPU 占用。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff": "按相机位置计算画质衰减",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.useCameraPositionForQualityDropOff.@tooltip": "启用后，DH 会尝试按相机位置\n计算 LOD 画质衰减。\n禁用后则按玩家位置计算。\n\n启用有助于自由相机模组正确渲染。\n禁用有助于多相机模组正确渲染，如沉浸式传送门或摄像机模组。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn": "放大视野时提高画质",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.increaseQualityWhenZoomedIn.@tooltip": "启用后，使用望远镜或缩放模组放大画面时，\n会提高 LOD 画质。\n\n仅影响相机视野内可见的 LOD。\n\n放大时，LOD 会加载到相当于\n近距离观察时的细节等级。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease": "缩放画质提升上限",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.maxZoomQualityIncrease.@tooltip": "缩放最多可提高多少个 LOD 细节等级。\n数值越大，放大后地形越清晰，\n但缩放时内存与 GPU 占用也越高。\n\n原版望远镜需要提高 4 个细节等级才能达到完整画质。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale": "水平比例",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.horizontalScale.@tooltip": "控制 LOD 画质降低的速度。\n\n数值越大，远处地形越精细，\n但内存与 GPU 占用也越高。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.transparency": "透明效果",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading": "LOD 明暗处理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodShading.@tooltip": "设置 LOD 的明暗处理方式。\n可用于改善与光影的兼容性。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering": "草方块侧面渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.grassSideRendering.@tooltip": "草方块 LOD 的侧面和底面应如何渲染？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade": "淡出近处的 DH LOD",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.ditherDhFade.@tooltip": "启用后，LOD 会在相机靠近时逐渐淡出。\n禁用后，LOD 会在距相机指定距离处突然消失。\n此项受原版过度绘制防止设置影响。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode": "原版画面淡入模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.vanillaFadeMode.@tooltip": "原版 Minecraft 画面应如何与 Distant Horizons LOD 过渡？\n\nNONE：最快，DH 与原版渲染之间会有明显边界。\nSINGLE_PASS：在原版透明渲染阶段后淡入，水下不透明方块不会淡入。\nDOUBLE_PASS：最慢，在原版不透明和透明渲染阶段后分别淡入，过渡最平滑。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.dhFadeFarClipPlane": "在远裁剪面之前淡出",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.dhFadeFarClipPlane.@tooltip": "DH 是否应在到达远裁剪面之前淡出？\n可避免 DH 云层在远处突然被截断。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.brightnessMultiplier": "亮度倍率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.brightnessMultiplier.@tooltip": "LOD 颜色的亮度。\n\n0 = 黑色\n1 = 正常\n2 = 接近白色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.saturationMultiplier": "饱和度倍率",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.saturationMultiplier.@tooltip": "LOD 颜色的饱和程度。\n\n0 = 黑白\n1 = 正常\n2 = 鲜艳",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending": "生物群系混合",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.quality.lodBiomeBlending.@tooltip": "与原版生物群系混合设置作用相同，但用于 LOD 区域。\n\n注意：任何大于 0 的值都会增加 LOD 加载耗时。\n\n0 相当于原版生物群系混合的 1×1，\n1 相当于 3×3，\n2 相当于 5×5，以此类推……\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableSsao": "启用环境光遮蔽",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableSsao.@tooltip": "环境光遮蔽可让方块光照更有层次感。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableAntiAliasing": "启用抗锯齿",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.enableAntiAliasing.@tooltip": "启用抗锯齿可平滑边缘，减少移动时的闪烁。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering": "通用对象渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableGenericRendering": "启用通用对象渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableGenericRendering.@tooltip": "启用后，DH 会渲染非地形对象，\n例如信标光束和云层。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering": "启用信标渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.beaconRenderHeight": "信标渲染高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.beaconRenderHeight.@tooltip": "设置信标可渲染到的最高高度。需要重新载入世界后生效。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons": "加宽远处信标",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.expandDistantBeacons.@tooltip": "启用后，极远处的 LOD 信标光束会加宽，\n以便看清。\n禁用后，所有 LOD 信标光束均保持 1 格宽。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableBeaconRendering.@tooltip": "启用后，会渲染 LOD 信标光束。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering": "启用云层渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableCloudRendering.@tooltip": "启用后，会渲染 LOD 云层。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv": "启用云层的维度 CSV 列表",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.dimensionEnabledCloudRenderingCsv.@tooltip": "允许 DH 渲染云层的维度资源标识符列表，以逗号分隔。\n\n示例：\"minecraft:overworld,minecraft:the_end\"\n\n修改后需要重新载入世界。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds": "启用多层云",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.genericRendering.enableMultiLayerClouds.@tooltip": "关闭：DH 像原版 Minecraft 一样渲染单层云。\n开启：DH 在不同高度渲染 3 层云。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog": "雾",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog": "启用 Distant Horizons 雾效",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableDhFog.@tooltip": "决定是否在 DH LOD 上绘制雾。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode": "雾颜色模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.colorMode.@tooltip": "LOD 上雾的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog": "启用原版雾效",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.enableVanillaFog.@tooltip": "§6开启：§rMinecraft 正常渲染雾。\n§6关闭：§r禁用原版区块上的雾。\n\n可能与其他修改雾效的模组发生兼容问题。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.advancedFog": "高级雾选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart": "雾起点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogStart.@tooltip": "雾应从哪里开始？\n\n0.0：从玩家位置开始。\n1.0：雾起点圆形恰好内接于 LOD 渲染距离正方形。\n1.414：LOD 渲染距离正方形恰好内接于雾起点圆形。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd": "雾终点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogEnd.@tooltip": "雾应在哪里达到终点？\n\n0.0：在玩家位置结束。\n1.0：雾终点圆形恰好内接于 LOD 渲染距离正方形。\n1.414：LOD 渲染距离正方形恰好内接于雾终点圆形。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin": "雾最小浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMin.@tooltip": "雾的最小浓度是多少？\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax": "雾最大浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogMax.@tooltip": "雾的最大浓度是多少？\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff": "雾衰减方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogFalloff.@tooltip": "如何计算雾的浓度？\n\nLINEAR：按距离线性变化，忽略密度。\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(distance*density))\nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((distance*density)^2))\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.farFogDensity.@tooltip": "雾的密度是多少？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog": "高度雾选项",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode": "高度雾混合模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMixMode.@tooltip": "设置高度对雾的影响。不确定时可先尝试 SPHERICAL、ADDITION 或 MAX。\n\nSPHERICAL：按相机距离计算雾。\nCYLINDRICAL：忽略高度，按水平距离计算雾。\nMAX：max(heightFog, farFog)\nADDITION：heightFog + farFog\nMULTIPLY：heightFog * farFog\nINVERSE_MULTIPLY：1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog)\nLIMITED_ADDITION：farFog + max(farFog, heightFog)\nMULTIPLY_ADDITION：farFog + farFog * heightFog\nINVERSE_MULTIPLY_ADDITION：farFog + 1 - (1-heightFog) * (1-farFog)\nAVERAGE：farFog*0.5 + heightFog*0.5",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection": "高度雾方向",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDirection.@tooltip": "高度雾应位于何处？\n\nABOVE_CAMERA：从相机向天空延伸。\nBELOW_CAMERA：从相机向虚空延伸。\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_CAMERA：从相机同时向天空和虚空延伸。\nABOVE_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度向天空延伸。\nBELOW_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度向虚空延伸。\nABOVE_AND_BELOW_SET_HEIGHT：从指定高度同时向天空和虚空延伸。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight": "高度雾基准高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogBaseHeight.@tooltip": "若围绕指定高度计算高度雾，应使用哪个高度？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart": "高度雾起点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogStart.@tooltip": "高度雾起点应偏移多少？\n\n0.0：不偏移。\n1.0：偏移整个世界高度，包含地下深度。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd": "高度雾终点",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogEnd.@tooltip": "高度雾终点应偏移多少？\n\n0.0：不偏移。\n1.0：偏移整个世界高度，包含地下深度。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin": "高度雾最小浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMin.@tooltip": "雾的最小浓度是多少？\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax": "高度雾最大浓度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogMax.@tooltip": "雾的最大浓度是多少？\n\n0.0：完全无雾。\n1.0：完全显示雾的颜色。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff": "高度雾衰减方式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogFalloff.@tooltip": "如何计算高度雾的浓度？\n\nLINEAR：按高度线性变化，忽略密度。\nEXPONENTIAL：1/(e^(height*density))\nEXPONENTIAL_SQUARED：1/(e^((height*density)^2))\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity": "高度雾密度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.fog.heightFog.heightFogDensity.@tooltip": "高度雾的密度是多少？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture": "LOD 纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods": "启用 LOD 纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.enableTexturedLods.@tooltip": "启用后，近处及放大观察的 LOD 会使用方块的\n实际纹理和轮廓，而非单一纯色。\n\n仅对纹理实际可见的高细节 LOD 生效，\n远处 LOD 始终使用纯色。\n启用光影包时无效，因为光影包会\n使用自己的程序渲染 LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel": "带纹理细节等级上限",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.maxTexturedLodDetailLevel.@tooltip": "可使用方块纹理渲染的最高细节等级数值。\n在更高的数值等级中，每个 LOD 覆盖多个方块，\n纹理小于一个像素，因此不可见。\n\n数值越大，越远处的 LOD 也会使用纹理，\n但内存占用会增加。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv": "不渲染纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontRenderTextureCsv.@tooltip": "不让 DH 渲染纹理的方块资源标识符，\n以逗号分隔。\n也支持部分匹配和不完整资源标识符。\n\n示例：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不使用侧面纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "指定方块的侧面将使用底部纹理渲染，\n方块资源标识符以逗号分隔。\n也支持部分匹配和不完整资源标识符。\n\n示例：\"minecraft:grass_block,nylium\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv": "不使用侧面纹理的方块标签",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blockTagsDontUseSideTextureCsv.@tooltip": "指定标签下的方块侧面将使用底部纹理渲染，\n标签名称以逗号分隔。\n\n示例：\"grass_blocks,nylium\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv": "始终光栅化纹理的方块",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.texture.blocksAlwaysRasterizeTextureCsv.@tooltip": "对指定方块使用光栅化来确定\n各个面的纹理，\n资源标识符以逗号分隔。\n\n可修复部分模组方块的侧面\n仅使用模型纹理一部分时的显示问题。\n\n示例：\"minecraft:beacon\"\n\n修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture": "噪声纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture": "启用噪声纹理",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.enableNoiseTexture.@tooltip": "启用后，会为 LOD 叠加噪声以模拟纹理。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps": "噪声级数",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseSteps.@tooltip": "设置应用于 LOD 的噪声级数。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity": "噪声强度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseIntensity.@tooltip": "设置噪声纹理的强度。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff": "噪声衰减距离",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.noiseTexture.noiseDropoff.@tooltip": "设置噪声纹理在多少格距离后淡出。\n设为 0 则不淡出。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling": "剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention": "防止过度绘制",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.overdrawPrevention.@tooltip": "设置 Distant Horizons 从距相机多远处开始渲染，\n以原版渲染距离的百分比计算。\n-1 = 自动，根据原版渲染距离调整。\n\n数值越大，越远处的原版方块后方也不会绘制 LOD，\n但可能让 LOD 出现空洞。\n在尚未加载的地形中飞行时最容易出现空洞。\n\n提高原版渲染距离会增强此设置的效果。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement": "快速移动时减少过度绘制",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.reduceOverdrawWithFastMovement.@tooltip": "启用后，快速飞行或移动时，\n防止过度绘制的半径会向相机靠近。\n\n有助于缓解原版 Minecraft 的区块加载或生成\n速度跟不上 DH 的情况。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling": "启用洞穴剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.enableCaveCulling.@tooltip": "启用后，会剔除洞穴。\n\n补充说明：目前会在没有顶层天花板的维度中，\n剔除洞穴剔除高度以下、天空光照为 0 的\n所有面。\n",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight": "洞穴剔除高度",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.caveCullingHeight.@tooltip": "从哪个 Y 坐标高度开始剔除洞穴？",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling": "启用信标距离剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableBeaconDistanceCulling.@tooltip": "启用后，靠近相机的信标不会绘制，以避免与原版重复绘制。\n禁用后，渲染所有信标。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling": "禁用视锥剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "关闭时，不绘制玩家相机视野之外的 LOD，\n以提高 GPU 性能。\n\n开启时，会绘制所有 LOD，包括相机后方的 LOD，\n从而降低 GPU 性能。\n\n如果视野边缘的 LOD 消失，可启用此选项来关闭剔除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling": "禁用阴影渲染阶段的视锥剔除",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.disableShadowPassFrustumCulling.@tooltip": "与另一个视锥剔除选项作用相同，\n但仅在光影模组通过 DH API\n渲染阴影阶段时使用。\n\n如果阴影显示异常，可关闭此剔除。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv": "忽略渲染的方块 CSV",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderBlockCsv.@tooltip": "DH 不渲染的方块资源标识符，以逗号分隔。\n空气始终包含在此列表中。\n\n注意：\n如果出现缝隙或空洞，可能需要将\nworldCompression 改为 [MERGE_SAME_BLOCKS]，并重新生成 LOD。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv": "忽略渲染的洞穴方块 CSV",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.ignoredRenderCaveBlockCsv.@tooltip": "在天空光照为 0 的地下区域中不渲染的\n方块资源标识符，以逗号分隔。\n空气始终包含在此列表中。\n\n默认为空列表，因为大多数洞穴方块会因\n透明、非实心或液体属性而自动被忽略；也可按需添加新方块。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水下表层方块替换",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSubSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "指定方块若出现在水面下且可见，将替换为水。\n方块资源标识符以逗号分隔。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv": "水面方块替换",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.waterSurfaceBlockReplacementCsv.@tooltip": "位于水面上的指定方块将被移除。\n方块资源标识符以逗号分隔。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore": "忽略的方块类型",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.blocksToIgnore.@tooltip": "设置哪些方块应渲染为 LOD。\n\n§NONE:§rLOD 包含所有方块。\n§NON_COLLIDING:§rLOD 仅渲染实心方块，忽略高草丛、火把等。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks": "使用被忽略方块的颜色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.culling.tintWithAvoidedBlocks.@tooltip": "§4注意：会使雪、地毯和活板门看起来很差。§r\n被忽略方块下方的方块是否应采用其颜色？\n§6开启：§r草方块上的红花会将下方草地染红。\n§6关闭：§r跳过的方块不改变下方表面的颜色。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings": "覆盖原版设置",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.overrideVanillaGraphicsSettings.@tooltip": "启用后，DH 初始化时会自动调整部分原版\n图形设置，以改善体验。\n\n例如禁用原版云层（会绘制在 DH LOD 之上），\n以及区块淡入效果（DH 已经会让原版区块淡入）。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio": "地球曲率比例",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.earthCurveRatio.@tooltip": "数值 1 相当于真实地球的曲率。\n允许的最小值为 50，最大值为 5000。\n1 至 49 之间的值会向上调整为 50。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv": "忽略的维度 CSV",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.ignoredDimensionCsv.@tooltip": "DH 不进行渲染的维度资源标识符，以逗号分隔。示例：\"minecraft:the_nether,minecraft:the_end\"\n\nMinecraft 1.12.2 及更早版本：\n打开 F3 界面，复制黄色的 dimension_name:ID。示例：\"overworld:0\"\n\n注意：\n禁用 DH 渲染时，部分 DH 设置会被禁用或调整，\n以改善画面。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine": "渲染引擎",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.graphics.experimental.renderingEngine.@tooltip": "修改后需要重启。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater": "自动更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableAutoUpdater": "启用自动更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableSilentUpdates": "启用静默更新",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.enableSilentUpdates.@tooltip": "有可用更新时自动更新模组",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.updateBranch": "更新分支",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.autoUpdater.updateBranch.@tooltip": "从何处下载最新更新。\n\n自动：根据当前 JAR 选择稳定版或每夜构建版。\n稳定版：来自 Modrinth 的稳定构建。\n每夜构建版：来自 GitLab 的每夜构建。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer": "多人游戏",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode": "服务器文件夹命名模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.multiplayer.serverFolderNameMode.@tooltip": "设置本地多人游戏数据的文件夹格式。\n\n§6仅名称：§r\n使用服务器列表中的名称，例如 \"Minecraft Server\"。\n§6仅 IP：§r\n\"192.168.1.40\"\n§6名称、IP：§r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40\"\n§6名称、IP、端口：§r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565\"\n§6名称、IP、端口、MC 版本：§r\n\"Minecraft Server, IP 192.168.1.40:25565, GameVersion 1.18.1\"\n\n§c§l注意：§r连接多人服务器时修改此项可能导致异常。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.rendererMode": "渲染器模式",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugRenderingColors": "调试渲染颜色",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.lodOnlyMode": "仅渲染 LOD",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.lodOnlyMode.@tooltip": "启用后，会禁用大部分原版 Minecraft 渲染。\n\n注意：请勿在此模式下报告问题！\n此项仅供娱乐与调试，\n不保证与其他模组兼容。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.renderWireframe": "渲染线框",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.renderWireframe.@tooltip": "启用后，LOD 会以线框形式渲染。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableDebugKeybindings": "启用调试快捷键",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableDebugKeybindings.@tooltip": "启用后，可用以下按键切换调试状态。\nF6：开关 LOD 渲染。\nF7：开关仅渲染 LOD。\nF8：循环切换不同调试渲染模式。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableWhiteWorld": "启用白色世界",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.enableWhiteWorld.@tooltip": "启用后，不传递顶点颜色。\n适合调试光影。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.showOverlappingQuadErrors": "显示重叠四边形错误",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.showOverlappingQuadErrors.@tooltip": "启用后，重叠的四边形会显示为亮红色，便于识别。\n禁用后，正常渲染这些四边形。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.logBufferGarbageCollection": "记录缓冲区垃圾回收",
