  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.allowUnsafeValues": "允许界面输入不安全的值",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.allowUnsafeValues.@tooltip": "启用后，仅对配置输入执行非常有限的校验。\n\n警告：启用可能导致不稳定或崩溃，风险自负。\n注意：此选项不会跨游戏会话保存。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe": "调试线框",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.enableRendering": "启用调试线框渲染",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.enableRendering.@tooltip": "启用后，会绘制用于调试内部功能的各类线框。",
  "distanthorizons.config.client.advanced.debugging.debugWireframe.showWorldGenQueue": "显示世界生成队列",
